"], [\"Could you please log that I phoned Vymie Kaczmarek today?\", \"Thank you. Would you mind telling me when we last spoke?\", \"Sorry, quick question before I forget: did I delete the chaffinch photo?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w11-0030\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me which tasks I finished last weekend?\", \"Would you mind booking Dunedin Rise on their website for the weekend, please?\", \"Could you please get rid of the questions note?\", \"Would you move the ask wysou task to thursday and the call to saturday, please?\"], [\"tasks done last weekend?\", \"book Dunedin Rise online for the weekend\", \"bin questions note\", \"ask wysou to thursday, call to saturday\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w11-0032\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please save the safe code 85346 in the locker?\", \"Would you star the nightjar bill document, and also add a task to print the nightjar bill monday, please?\", \"Could you add twenty dollars for groceries to the pavilion collective group? I paid for it.\"], [\"save safe code 85346 in locker\", \"star nightjar bill doc, task: print the nightjar bill monday\", \"twenty dollars groceries, pavilion collective, I paid\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w11-0033\", \"v\": [[\"For this week, could you tell me how many tasks I have due?\", \"Could you please look up Fergus Crystak for me?\"], [\"this week: how many tasks due?\", \"find Fergus Crystak\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w11-0034\", \"v\": [[\"this week which tasks have i got due\", \"ok can u add Jolua to the number 48 flat group pls\"], [\"umm so this week, uh, which tasks have I actually got due?\", \"oh and can you, um, put Jolua into the number 48 flat group?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w11-0035\", \"v\": [[\"where's the brooch close-up?\", \"anything mentioning Noskine\", \"hang on — Wysou photos?\", \"ok back to that — in my notes too?\", \"haircut next friday at 9:30\"], [\"Could you tell me where the brooch close-up went?\", \"Would you show me everything that mentions Noskine, please?\", \"Sorry, quick one before I forget — could you show me photos of Wysou?\", \"Going back to what we were looking at before, is it in my notes as well?\", \"Could you please put a haircut in the calendar next friday at 9:30?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w11-0036\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me when I'm next seeing Vymie Gastacre?\", \"Would you mind moving the first one to sunday and cancelling the second one, please?\", \"Could you please clear what's owed between me and Malik Thithak?\", \"How much was the candlemaking workshop, if you don't mind me asking?\"], [\"next time seeing Vymie Gastacre?\", \"first to sunday, cancel second\", \"square up with Malik Thithak\", \"candlemaking workshop cost?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w11-0037\", \"v\": [[\"I keep forgetting this every single time I need it, so just so it's somewhere safe: the safe code is 5457 — can you keep it in the locker for me?\", \"My photos are getting really cluttered and I'm trying to tidy up a bit, so could you trash the Laimie picture?\", \"Oh no, wait, I really didn't mean to do that — could you undo it and put it back?\"], [\"Could you please keep the safe code in the locker? It's 5457. Oh — to be clear, the safe code is 5457.\", \"Would you mind trashing the Laimie picture, please?\", \"I'm sorry, could you undo that, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w11-0038\", \"v\": [[\"I'm trying to plan out the next little while and I honestly can't remember off the top of my head — what day is the brooch viewing on?\"], [\"uh, what day's the, um… the brooch viewing on?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w11-0039\", \"v\": [[\"which group is the dumpling expense in\", \"wat else went into that group\"], [\"um, which group did the dumpling thing go into?\", \"okay and, uh, what else is in that one?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w11-0042\", \"v\": [[\"umm have I got any, uh, candle pictures?\", \"oh, and what about Vruwen?\", \"okay different thing — can you, um, settle up with everyone who owes me in pavilion collective?\"], [\"got any candle pictures\", \"what about Vruwen\", \"also settle up w everyone who owes me in pavilion collective pls\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w11-0043\", \"v\": [[\"how much did i spend back in March\", \"can u pull up the hyford villa thing\", \"actually nvm dont bother\"], [\"Could you tell me how much I spent back in March?\", \"Would you please pull up the hyford villa item?\", \"Actually, please don't worry about it — no need, thank you.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w11-0044\", \"v\": [[\"garden centre locker entry\"], [\"um, can you find the, uh, garden centre entry in my locker? just the entry itself\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w11-0045\", \"v\": [[\"I need to get into my account and I've completely blanked on it, so what's the actual password for the garden centre? The garden centre password, I mean.\", \"Right, I'm finally setting things up properly and I'm rubbish at making these, so could you come up with a password for the gym account?\", \"Totally different thing, I'm trying to tidy up my list — can you show me the climbing tasks, then tick off the first one and delete the second?\"], [\"garden centre password?\", \"make up a gym account password\", \"climbing tasks — tick first, delete second\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w11-0046\", \"v\": [[\"whats the villa door code\"], [\"I can never remember it and I always end up standing there fumbling, so what's the villa door code again?\"]]}","ttft_ms":25789,"type":"result","duration_ms":42817,"uuid":"46b631da-586f-40f4-9964-daf189c0dd2a","ttft_stream_ms":1266,"time_to_request_ms":126,"first_content_frame_ms":1266,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":22000193,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"time_origin_ms":1790278550763.0208,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
